{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838650/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1753437615\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838650/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webm?t=1753437615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838650/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.mp4?t=1753437615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc8e <strong>MEET CARMILLA!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An elegant vampire whose fingers are cold as moonlight and glide across skin like silk shadows. Her heart may no longer beat, but her gaze burns with a hunger that leaves mortals dizzy. Every move of this seductive aristocrat is an invitation to join her in wicked pleasures, one you can't (and won't) resist...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In bed, Carmilla is methodical and teasing. She explores you slowly, savoring every inch of your body. She plays\u2014with your skin, your breath, your very heartbeat. Her favorite toys are silk blindfolds, spiked cuffs, and lace stockings. She doesn't need to enchant you to taste your blood\u2014you'll give yourself to her willingly...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838650/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.avif?t=1753437615\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcdc <strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Carmilla as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab on the home screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'l